CLASS net/minecraft/world/InteractionResult
	COMMENT An enum indicating the hand interaction's result.
	COMMENT Methods called on hand interaction, such as {@link net.minecraft.world.entity.Mob#interact}, return this.
	FIELD CONSUME Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$Success;
		COMMENT Indicates an action is performed but no animation should accompany the performance.
	FIELD FAIL Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$Fail;
		COMMENT Indicates that an action is not performed and prevents other actions from performing.
	FIELD PASS Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$Pass;
		COMMENT Indicates an action is not performed but allows other actions to perform.
	FIELD SUCCESS Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$Success;
		COMMENT Indicates an action is performed
		COMMENT and the actor's hand should swing to indicate the performance.
	FIELD SUCCESS_SERVER Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$Success;
		COMMENT Indicates an action is performed on the logical server only
		COMMENT and the actor's hand should swing to indicate the performance.
	FIELD TRY_WITH_EMPTY_HAND Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$TryEmptyHandInteraction;
		COMMENT Indicates an action is not performed
		COMMENT and the default block action should be performed instead.
	METHOD consumesAction isAccepted ()Z
		COMMENT {@return {@code true} if the action is performed, or {@code false} otherwise}
	CLASS ItemContext
		FIELD DEFAULT Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$ItemContext;
			COMMENT An item context which specifies that there has been an item interaction without consuming the item in hand.
		FIELD heldItemTransformedTo heldItemTransformedTo Lnet/minecraft/world/item/ItemStack;
			COMMENT the item stack that should replace the hand stack after an interaction, if any
		FIELD NONE Lnet/minecraft/world/InteractionResult$ItemContext;
			COMMENT An item context which specifies that there has been no item interaction and no items should be consumed from the hand.
		FIELD wasItemInteraction wasItemInteraction Z
			COMMENT {@code true} if an item interaction happened which should increment item usage statistics, or {@code false} otherwise
		METHOD heldItemTransformedTo heldItemTransformedTo ()Lnet/minecraft/world/item/ItemStack;
		METHOD wasItemInteraction wasItemInteraction ()Z
	CLASS Success
		METHOD heldItemTransformedTo ()Lnet/minecraft/world/item/ItemStack;
			COMMENT {@return the item stack that should replace the hand stack after an interaction, or {@code null} otherwise}
		METHOD wasItemInteraction ()Z
			COMMENT {@return {@code true} if an item interaction happened which should increment item usage statistics, or {@code false} otherwise}
	CLASS SwingSource
		COMMENT Represents the side that should be considered the source of truth for an arm swing, if any.
